# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for the vouchfx-mcp .NET 8 solution
# Covers: .NET build output, Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code, NuGet, test
# results, local secrets, and OS cruft.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
out/
artifacts/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb

## Rendered GitHub Pages site — regenerated by scripts/build_site.py from
## site/ + the repository's markdown on every build/CI run. Never committed.
/_site/

## .NET tool / restore caches
.dotnet/
.packages/

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
_nupkg/

## Test results & coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coverletoutput
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
TestResults/

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

## Rider / JetBrains
.idea/

## Visual Studio Code
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

## Roslyn / MSBuild
*.binlog
msbuild.log
msbuild.err
msbuild.wrn

## Local secrets & environment — never commit resolved credentials
*.secrets
secrets.json
secrets.local.*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

## OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Logs & temp
*.log
*.tmp

# Maintainer-local spec material — mirrors the vouchfx engine repo's
# convention of keeping specs/<name>.md (the spec -> build -> review loop's
# input) out of the published tree.
/specs/

.claude/
